i integrated kodoai (https://gokodoai.com), and honestly, it's been a game-changer. what impressed me most was the power of its 'skills' feature. instead of crafting complex transformation chains, i just called skills like optimizeforwebp or resizetofitcontainer. it instantly handled resizing, compression, and format conversion.

